message: "If you use BRIDGE in your research, please cite the software and the associated paper."
title: "BRIDGE: Block Rewiring from Inference-Derived Graph Ensembles"
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jr419/BRIDGE"
abstract: "BRIDGE is a graph rewiring framework that uses stochastic block models to create graph structures for improved node classification and includes sensitivity and signal-to-noise ratio analysis tools."
keywords:
  - graph neural networks
  - graph rewiring
  - message passing neural networks
  - signal-to-noise ratio
  - sensitivity analysis
  - homophily
